# trails_mob (kenshi-k16.19.6.1): four patrols of fifteen, mutually hostile, on the open wilderness ground of beak_open_ground, 630 u from the Hub bar
# (whose Barman and three Ninja Guards the wire streams too: 60 + 4 = the trails' 64-character cap exactly, so no character is ever evicted and every
# fighter's four tracks fill in one run). Two Blood raider patrols face two Berserker ones from 200 u apart and chase; at simspeed 5 the tracks fill at
# the decimation's top rate, so an unbounded draw passes 65,536 vertices in seconds and 1<<20 with every track full (the k16.19.6 bug).
KSCEN 2
